    "updated_at": "2017-03-14T07:55:59Z",
    "body": "> See http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/4936\r\n> It seems that in Chromium and Gecko this case is sync (doesn't await a stable state).\r\n\r\nGecko now always sync loads image for non-responsive case (without `picture` and `srcset`), but we intent to change behaviour to follow the current spec, so http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/4936 will become async (await a stable state) after https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1076583.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
